flowchart LR
  U[Engineer / Browser] --> CF[CloudFront ESC SIL Dashboard]
  CF --> S3D[(Private S3 Dashboard Bucket)]
  U -->|X-Admin-Token| API[API Gateway HTTP API]
  API --> L[Control Lambda]
  L --> SSM[AWS Systems Manager]

  SSM -->|Start ZCU service| ZCU[c7i x86_64 EC2\nZCU / ESC Controller]
  SSM -->|Start maneuver| HPC[c8g Graviton4 EC2\nHPC / Vehicle Dynamics]

  subgraph VPC[AWS VPC — real private Ethernet/IP]
    HPC -->|UDP/5005 @ 100 Hz\nsteering, speed, yaw, ay, beta| ZCU
    ZCU -->|UDP response\nESC corrective yaw moment| HPC
  end

  MAN[FMVSS 126-inspired\nSine-with-Dwell] --> HPC
  HPC --> VEH[Nonlinear bicycle\nvehicle model]
  VEH --> HPC
  HPC --> MET[Yaw decay + lateral displacement\nFMVSS-style metrics]

  HPC -->|trace + network RTT + vehicle result| S3R[(S3 Results Bucket)]
  ZCU -->|packet + controller timing result| S3R
  L --> DDB[(DynamoDB Run Metadata)]
  U -->|Poll results| API
  API --> L
  L --> S3R

  SG[Security Group\nUDP/5005 only worker-SG to worker-SG] -. protects .-> VPC
